Package: binance
Type: Package
Title: API Wrapper to Binance Cryptocurrency Exchange
Version: 0.5.3
URL: https://dereckscompany.github.io/binance/
BugReports: https://github.com/dereckscompany/binance/issues
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Dereck",
           family = "Mezquita",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "dereck@mezquita.io",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9307-6762"))
Description: R API wrapper to the Binance cryptocurrency exchange supporting
    both synchronous and asynchronous (promise based) operations. Provides R6
    classes for spot market data, trading (including OCO orders), account
    management, deposits, withdrawals, internal transfers, margin trading,
    margin data, sub-accounts, Simple Earn, and USD-M futures (market data and
    trading). Includes bulk kline backfill with CSV resume support, live
    event-driven WebSocket market-data streams (order book depth), and timestamp
    conversion utilities.
